WEBVTT

00:00:12.055 --> 00:00:15.600
Honda-kun, how did you know about this place?

00:00:15.808 --> 00:00:18.436
You've been wanting to come, haven't you?

00:00:22.857 --> 00:00:25.610
You like this kind of stuff?

00:00:26.611 --> 00:00:27.529
Was it then?

00:00:27.737 --> 00:00:29.531
Yeah.

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:32.200
I'm glad we got to come.

00:00:32.408 --> 00:00:34.118
Let's eat.

00:00:34.744 --> 00:00:36.454
Okay.

00:00:46.714 --> 00:00:49.300
Thank you.

00:00:49.509 --> 00:00:51.094
Was it good?

00:00:51.302 --> 00:00:53.888
--Yeah.
--All right!

00:00:54.097 --> 00:00:57.475
But I wish you would've
shared your cake with me.

00:00:57.684 --> 00:00:59.269
You wouldn't even let me have one bite.

00:00:59.477 --> 00:01:00.728
Of course not.

00:01:00.937 --> 00:01:02.939
Why not?

00:01:03.147 --> 00:01:04.899
Why not? Because...

00:01:05.108 --> 00:01:06.734
You just can't, okay?

00:01:06.943 --> 00:01:11.698
Aw, I wanted some of yours.

00:01:11.906 --> 00:01:15.285
You always say things like that.

00:01:27.547 --> 00:01:31.676
| have a curfew. Sorry, I need to go home.

00:01:31.884 --> 00:01:33.303
I'll leave this here.

00:01:33.511 --> 00:01:35.138
Huh? Wait.

00:01:35.346 --> 00:01:35.972
Bye.

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:38.016
Wait! I'll walk you home.

00:01:38.224 --> 00:01:41.019
That's okay. See you later.

00:01:41.227 --> 00:01:44.230
Thanks for today.

00:01:48.693 --> 00:01:52.113
Sorry, things ran late.

00:01:52.322 --> 00:01:55.742
| know. I'm almost there.

