Oh, I gotta stand up now

00:03:39.387 --> 00:03:41.556
"November"

00:03:41.556 --> 00:03:42.390
"November"
Cake?

00:03:42.390 --> 00:03:42.598
"November"

00:03:42.598 --> 00:03:44.434
"November"
It was pretty good.

00:03:44.434 --> 00:03:44.559
"November"

00:03:44.642 --> 00:03:46.728
This was it.

00:03:46.936 --> 00:03:48.146
What are you, a girl?

00:03:48.354 --> 00:03:50.732
Who cares?

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:52.817
| wish we could've spent more time together.

00:03:53.025 --> 00:03:54.152
Oh, really?

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:56.112
That's not much of a reaction.

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:59.240
Listen, I want to spend all my time with her.

00:03:59.449 --> 00:04:02.118
She's started replying to
my messages right away, too.

00:04:02.326 --> 00:04:03.578
Yeah, yeah.

00:04:03.786 --> 00:04:05.079
You jealous?

00:04:05.288 --> 00:04:06.956
Shut up.

00:04:08.082 --> 00:04:09.041
Cake?

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.501
Yeah.

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:12.545
That sounds nice.

00:04:12.754 --> 00:04:13.921
You think so?

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:16.007
Yeah.

00:04:16.215 --> 00:04:18.342
| see.

00:04:18.551 --> 00:04:23.389
Class rep, do you have time for tea today?

00:04:23.598 --> 00:04:25.516
| was hoping to stop by the bookstore today.

00:04:25.725 --> 00:04:28.269
Then I'll walk you there.

00:04:28.478 --> 00:04:30.438
That would be okay.

00:04:32.857 --> 00:04:34.817
Actually, sorry. I have to go!

00:04:35.026 --> 00:04:36.319
Huh?

00:04:53.878 --> 00:04:56.464
"Mihashi Mami"

00:04:56.464 --> 00:04:59.967
"Mihashi Mami"
"Are you asleep?" "Honda"

00:05:07.892 --> 00:05:10.895
"Mihashi Mami"
"Are you asleep?" "Honda"

00:05:15.525 --> 00:05:17.652
Good morning, class rep.

00:05:18.736 --> 00:05:20.404
Good morning.

00:05:20.613 --> 00:05:22.490
So, uh...

00:05:22.698 --> 00:05:23.491
Sorry.

00:05:23.699 --> 00:05:25.243
Oh, it's okay.

00:05:25.451 --> 00:05:27.662
So, about yesterday...

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:28.996
It's my brother.

00:05:29.205 --> 00:05:31.541
He happened to pass by.

00:05:31.749 --> 00:05:33.835
Did he say something to you?

00:05:34.043 --> 00:05:38.673
No, it's not that serious.

00:05:38.881 --> 00:05:40.633
But...

00:05:41.467 --> 00:05:44.178
She says we can't walk
home together for a while.

00:05:44.387 --> 00:05:46.055
It's no wonder they're worried.

00:05:46.264 --> 00:05:47.974
She's spending time with you.

00:05:49.058 --> 00:05:52.019
Mihashi-san's family does
flower arrangements.

00:05:52.228 --> 00:05:53.896
They seem strict.

00:05:54.105 --> 00:05:56.315
Flower arrangements?

00:05:56.524 --> 00:05:57.608
Yeah.

00:05:57.817 --> 00:05:59.610
Her father's a lawyer.

00:05:59.819 --> 00:06:02.196
Her brother's going to be one, too.

00:06:02.405 --> 00:06:04.282
Lawyers...

00:06:05.449 --> 00:06:09.745
Because of that, her family
lets her stay out past curfew

00:06:09.954 --> 00:06:12.874
if it's for school events.

00:06:15.626 --> 00:06:17.336
That sounds rough.

00:06:17.545 --> 00:06:18.629
Yeah.

00:06:18.838 --> 00:06:20.047
| see.

00:06:20.256 --> 00:06:23.217
Mihashi does seem well put together.

00:06:23.426 --> 00:06:25.928
| know.

00:06:26.137 --> 00:06:32.351
| know that, but I had
no idea about her family.

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:35.563
I'm so lame.

00:06:36.731 --> 00:06:40.568
"Hakuundou Bookstore"

00:06:43.112 --> 00:06:45.448
Mihashi-san?

00:06:45.656 --> 00:06:47.533
| didn't think you were coming today.

00:06:47.742 --> 00:06:49.911
I'm going to be taking
more classes for a while.

00:06:50.119 --> 00:06:52.788
Really? You're studying hard.

00:07:07.261 --> 00:07:09.096
Honda-kun?

00:07:10.932 --> 00:07:12.350
Can we talk?

00:07:12.558 --> 00:07:13.267
What?

00:07:13.476 --> 00:07:16.979
I-I can't. Someone's coming to pick me up.

00:07:21.067 --> 00:07:23.319
Honda-kun, my hand!

00:07:23.527 --> 00:07:25.404
Sorry.

00:07:25.613 --> 00:07:27.698
You surprised me.

00:07:27.907 --> 00:07:29.867
I'm sorry about everything.

00:07:30.076 --> 00:07:32.078
What?

00:07:32.286 --> 00:07:36.457
| had no idea you'd been
pushing yourself so hard.

00:07:36.666 --> 00:07:38.125
No.

00:07:39.168 --> 00:07:42.922
It's my fault for not saying anything.

00:07:43.714 --> 00:07:47.051
Is there anything I can do?

00:07:47.259 --> 00:07:51.806
Thanks, but it's something I have to do.

00:07:52.014 --> 00:07:53.599
I've been thinking about it.

00:07:53.808 --> 00:07:56.644
If I improve my grades,

00:07:56.852 --> 00:08:02.692
they might say it's okay.

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:05.069
Class rep...

00:08:07.196 --> 00:08:11.575
Doesn't that mean you'll
be even busier from now on?

00:08:11.784 --> 00:08:12.827
Yeah.

00:08:13.035 --> 00:08:15.079
| see.

00:08:15.287 --> 00:08:16.998
Good luck.

00:08:17.206 --> 00:08:19.291
Honda-kun?

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:22.670
If that's the decision you've
made, I'll support it.

00:08:22.878 --> 00:08:25.548
But don't push yourself too hard.

00:08:25.756 --> 00:08:28.467
You can be so serious.

00:08:30.344 --> 00:08:32.263
Thanks.

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:50.740
I'm home.

00:08:50.948 --> 00:08:52.450
Welcome back!

00:08:52.658 --> 00:08:55.536
Good. I thought I'd miss you on my way out.

00:08:55.745 --> 00:08:56.704
What?

00:08:56.912 --> 00:08:59.081
If you needed something,
you could've e-mailed me.

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:02.543
| thought it'd be better
to tell you in person.

00:09:08.799 --> 00:09:10.426
What are you doing here?

00:09:10.634 --> 00:09:12.553
Heh, I'm here.

00:09:12.762 --> 00:09:14.722
Don't be so corny.

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:15.765
You already eat dinner?

00:09:15.973 --> 00:09:17.266
Yeah.

00:09:17.475 --> 00:09:20.227
Hey, Akira! You there?

00:09:23.397 --> 00:09:26.233
Towa, the monster's coming! Help!

00:09:26.442 --> 00:09:27.943
Leave it to me.

00:09:28.152 --> 00:09:30.946
Here comes my miracle bomber.

00:09:31.947 --> 00:09:34.700
All right! We beat it!

00:09:34.909 --> 00:09:37.036
Hell yeah! Go me!

00:09:37.244 --> 00:09:40.039
Let's do the next quest.

00:09:47.838 --> 00:09:49.507
Morning practice with the soccer club?

00:09:49.715 --> 00:09:51.258
It's voluntary.

00:09:51.467 --> 00:09:55.221
| can't see the class rep, and
| don't feel like going home.

00:09:55.429 --> 00:09:57.473
What else can I do but run?

00:09:57.681 --> 00:09:59.308
Ah, is that how it is?

00:09:59.517 --> 00:10:02.144
Don't act like it's no big deal.

00:10:04.271 --> 00:10:07.149
It's starting to get cold.

00:10:07.358 --> 00:10:10.402
Maybe I should order extra steamed buns.

00:10:11.278 --> 00:10:13.030
What do you think, Nasa-kun?

00:10:13.239 --> 00:10:15.950
Yeah, should be soon.

00:10:58.701 --> 00:11:00.619
Excuse me.

00:11:02.746 --> 00:11:05.833
Sorry, Honda-kun!

00:11:06.041 --> 00:11:07.293
| made you do it all yourself.

00:11:07.501 --> 00:11:09.253
| can manage this myself.

00:11:09.461 --> 00:11:10.171
But...

00:11:10.379 --> 00:11:14.091
It's fine. At least let me do this.

00:11:14.300 --> 00:11:16.218
Thanks.

00:11:17.344 --> 00:11:18.888
Sure.

00:11:20.306 --> 00:11:23.142
Honda-kun took the notebooks
to the office for you?

00:11:23.350 --> 00:11:26.645
Yeah. I'm glad he noticed.

00:11:26.854 --> 00:11:31.400
I've had my hands full with what's
been going on right in front of me.

00:11:31.609 --> 00:11:33.235
So he picked up the slack.

00:11:33.444 --> 00:11:36.197
That's nice of Honda-kun.

00:11:38.699 --> 00:11:40.242
Mashiki-san!

00:11:40.451 --> 00:11:44.580
But I can't believe you forgot
your class rep duties.

00:11:44.788 --> 00:11:47.499
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:11:47.708 --> 00:11:49.126
Okay.

00:11:57.927 --> 00:11:59.053
What are you doing?

00:11:59.261 --> 00:12:00.930
| don't wanna go home.

00:12:01.138 --> 00:12:02.097
Again?

00:12:02.306 --> 00:12:05.226
Shut up. I'm deeply troubled, okay?

00:12:05.434 --> 00:12:07.603
"Deeply," huh?

00:12:07.811 --> 00:12:09.230
Wanna come over?

00:12:09.438 --> 00:12:10.648
Can 1?

00:12:10.856 --> 00:12:13.359
You're a pain in the butt, aren't you?

00:12:14.693 --> 00:12:17.238
--My dear friend!
--Hey, cut it out.

00:12:17.738 --> 00:12:21.325
Oh, uh... excuse me.

00:12:21.533 --> 00:12:23.160
Non-chan, they're here.

00:12:23.369 --> 00:12:25.204
Seriously?

00:12:25.412 --> 00:12:27.039
All right!

00:12:27.248 --> 00:12:31.377
Why are you dressed like that?

00:12:31.585 --> 00:12:32.753
Are you boys free?

00:12:32.962 --> 00:12:35.214
Could you help me with something?

00:12:35.422 --> 00:12:36.882
What?

00:12:42.429 --> 00:12:44.807
Iltokawa-san, thank you.

00:12:45.015 --> 00:12:47.226
And you.

00:12:48.727 --> 00:12:50.229
Mashiki.

00:12:50.437 --> 00:12:52.773
Let's start collecting ginkgo nuts.

00:12:52.982 --> 00:12:54.692
Ginkgo nuts?

00:12:59.071 --> 00:13:02.324
Ugh. How can you do this?

00:13:02.533 --> 00:13:04.576
We're the cooking society!

00:13:04.785 --> 00:13:07.079
How could we not collect ginkgo nuts?

00:13:07.288 --> 00:13:09.206
Look, Nasa-kun!

00:13:09.415 --> 00:13:11.959
Itokawa-san, that's amazing.

00:13:12.876 --> 00:13:14.586
You can make chawanmushi with these.

00:13:14.795 --> 00:13:15.921
Sure.

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:18.132
| want some chawanmushi, too.

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:20.175
That's what caught your interest?

00:13:20.384 --> 00:13:22.886
Chawanmushi is good, though.

00:13:23.095 --> 00:13:24.847
Oh, there's one over there.

00:13:25.055 --> 00:13:25.848
Where?

00:13:26.056 --> 00:13:27.808
Under the leaves.

00:13:28.017 --> 00:13:29.268
See?

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:31.020
You're right.

00:13:31.228 --> 00:13:32.938
Mishima-kun, get in position.

00:13:33.147 --> 00:13:34.815
Okay.

00:13:53.917 --> 00:13:55.336
What's wrong?

00:13:56.003 --> 00:13:58.630
The smell's whatever,
but they're really beautiful.

00:13:58.839 --> 00:14:02.217
| thought the class rep would
like it if I sent her a photo.

00:14:06.555 --> 00:14:08.349
You're not gonna send it?

00:14:08.557 --> 00:14:10.642
Not now.

00:14:10.851 --> 00:14:12.269
Another time.

00:14:12.478 --> 00:14:15.022
| don't want to interrupt
her if she's studying.

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:16.565
Right.

00:14:16.774 --> 00:14:18.609
Honda-kun...

00:14:21.653 --> 00:14:24.656
| wish the class rep were here.

00:14:30.371 --> 00:14:32.414
| still stink.

00:14:32.623 --> 00:14:34.416
We're taking a bath when we get home.

00:14:34.625 --> 00:14:36.085
That was fun.

00:14:36.293 --> 00:14:37.127
Yeah.

00:14:37.336 --> 00:14:39.463
| want chawanmushil

00:14:39.671 --> 00:14:41.715
Don't get ahead of yourself.

00:14:45.719 --> 00:14:46.887
What's wrong?

00:14:47.096 --> 00:14:49.014
Sorry, Haruki.

00:14:49.223 --> 00:14:51.225
| gotta go home.

00:14:53.519 --> 00:14:56.271
Welcome back.

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:58.524
You're wearing your track suit today?

00:14:58.732 --> 00:15:01.402
| thought you were working tonight.

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:04.029
| had my shift changed.

00:15:04.238 --> 00:15:05.864
We'll have time to talk.

00:15:06.073 --> 00:15:09.952
Really? Then I'm gonna take a bath first.

00:15:14.915 --> 00:15:17.418
| know how you feel.

00:15:17.626 --> 00:15:20.421
I'm just being selfish.

00:15:20.629 --> 00:15:21.880
You're not.

00:15:22.089 --> 00:15:29.304
Your stepdad's the one who said it'd be
better to live here until you graduated.

00:15:29.513 --> 00:15:32.891
Then why are we discussing this now?

00:15:33.100 --> 00:15:38.188
I've been busy lately and haven't
been able to see you much.

00:15:38.397 --> 00:15:44.111
Next year we'll have to start discussing
your future and entrance exams.

00:15:44.319 --> 00:15:47.406
He thought he'd be able to help us with that.

00:15:47.614 --> 00:15:48.407
And your stepdad said--

00:15:48.615 --> 00:15:50.659
Stepdad this, stepdad that.

00:15:50.868 --> 00:15:54.079
Do you do everything he says?

00:16:03.547 --> 00:16:06.633
Sorry. I know.

00:16:06.842 --> 00:16:09.720
| shouldn't have said that.

00:17:03.065 --> 00:17:05.234
It's freezing.

00:17:08.946 --> 00:17:12.449
"Friends"

00:17:15.452 --> 00:17:18.455
"Mihashi Mami"

00:18:00.998 --> 00:18:04.001
"Mihashi Mami"
"I miss you" "Honda"

00:18:33.739 --> 00:18:35.532
Honda-kun!

00:18:37.075 --> 00:18:38.076
Good morning.

00:18:38.285 --> 00:18:40.120
Good morning, class rep.

00:18:40.329 --> 00:18:41.955
Um, yesterday--

00:18:42.164 --> 00:18:43.624
Honda, you got a sec?

00:18:43.832 --> 00:18:45.584
I'll be right there.

00:18:45.792 --> 00:18:47.127
Sorry.

00:18:47.336 --> 00:18:48.879
Okay.

00:19:06.855 --> 00:19:09.941
Honda took the notebooks.

00:19:10.150 --> 00:19:12.444
| see.

00:19:24.164 --> 00:19:25.874
Stand.

00:19:26.625 --> 00:19:27.709
--Bow.
--Goodbye.

00:19:27.709 --> 00:19:30.045
--Goodbye.
--Goodbye.

00:19:31.463 --> 00:19:33.757
Honda, how far did you get in Wild Monster?

00:19:33.965 --> 00:19:35.676
The dungeon in Area 10.

00:19:35.884 --> 00:19:39.596
Seriously? I'm stuck in
the area right before that.

00:19:39.805 --> 00:19:42.474
Look it up. There's a strategy guide.

00:19:42.683 --> 00:19:47.604
| tried, but I can't get it to work.

00:20:07.165 --> 00:20:09.751
Um, Honda-kun.

00:20:10.919 --> 00:20:14.214
You're not usually here this late.

00:20:14.423 --> 00:20:16.550
| wanted to talk to you.

00:20:16.758 --> 00:20:19.386
Did something happen yesterday?

00:20:19.594 --> 00:20:20.721
Yeah.

00:20:20.929 --> 00:20:23.098
It's fine. It's already over.

00:20:23.306 --> 00:20:24.766
But...

00:20:25.642 --> 00:20:28.854
I'm sorry. I'm really busy right now.

00:20:29.062 --> 00:20:30.605
You can't help it.

00:20:30.814 --> 00:20:34.651
You're working hard for the both of us.

00:20:34.860 --> 00:20:38.572
Your family's worried because
I'm not responsible enough.

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:39.698
You're not--

00:20:39.906 --> 00:20:41.158
It's fine.

00:20:41.366 --> 00:20:44.536
But you're still willing to be with me.

00:20:44.745 --> 00:20:47.164
It's really nice of you.

00:20:47.372 --> 00:20:50.834
Sorry I'm so unreliable.

00:20:51.042 --> 00:20:56.298
| said I'd support you, but I'm just sulking.

00:20:56.506 --> 00:20:59.217
I'm not as reasonable as you are.

00:20:59.426 --> 00:21:01.928
Honda-kun, |--

00:21:06.224 --> 00:21:07.726
"Home"

00:21:26.077 --> 00:21:28.121
How long am I supposed to wait?

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:32.292
When will I come first?

00:21:32.501 --> 00:21:34.503
Honda-kun...

00:21:35.295 --> 00:21:39.216
How long are you going to keep worrying
about what your parents think?!

00:21:49.601 --> 00:21:52.437
I'm sorry.

00:21:52.646 --> 00:21:57.234
Maybe we can't work things out.

00:22:10.539 --> 00:22:19.047
Another city light blinks out

00:22:19.256 --> 00:22:28.890
Seems I'm the only one
being left behind like this

00:22:29.099 --> 00:22:37.607
I leaned in close to the light
of the vending machine

00:22:37.816 --> 00:22:46.741
And bought something
other than my usual coffee

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:51.413
I wonder if I can be myself

00:22:51.621 --> 00:22:57.460
From now on, and even further beyond

00:22:58.587 --> 00:23:07.554
Surely someday we'll come
to know sadness as love

00:23:07.762 --> 00:23:16.897
Reconnecting somewhere
and parting again, over and over

00:23:17.105 --> 00:23:30.660
Surely the day will come when we're
all too used to feeling joy

00:23:30.869 --> 00:23:37.208
Call that happiness

00:23:40.045 --> 00:23:41.254
"Next Time"

00:23:41.254 --> 00:23:44.215
"Next Time"
December, the season of couples.

00:23:44.215 --> 00:23:44.424
"Next Time"

00:23:44.424 --> 00:23:46.551
"Next Time"
Christmas songs decorate the town.

00:23:46.551 --> 00:23:46.760
"Next Time"

00:23:46.760 --> 00:23:48.970
"Next Time"
Lights twinkle in the corners of their eyes.

00:23:48.970 --> 00:23:49.179
"Next Time"

00:23:49.179 --> 00:23:53.308
"Next Time" His and her
feelings melt their frozen hearts.

00:23:53.308 --> 00:23:53.516
"Next Time"

00:23:53.516 --> 00:23:56.102
"Next Time"
They pray for them to melt.

00:23:56.102 --> 00:23:56.311
"Next Time"

00:23:56.311 --> 00:23:58.313
"Next Time"
They hurt and are hurt,

00:23:58.313 --> 00:23:58.521
"Next Time"

00:23:58.521 --> 00:24:01.775
"Next Time" but they still want
to see each other no matter what.

00:24:01.775 --> 00:24:01.983
"Next Time"

00:24:01.983 --> 00:24:04.945
"Next Time" Next time on Convenience Store
Boy Friends. Episode nine: "December."

00:24:04.945 --> 00:24:06.112
"Next Time" "December” Next time on Convenience
Store Boy Friends. Episode nine: "December.”

